Clang 23: raw_buffer_* builtins use unsigned vectors, not int32xN/float.

Same class of fix as python-xformers 0001-ck-tile-clang23-rdna.patch.
bit_cast load results; pass uint32 vectors to stores. Empty
CK_TILE_HOST_DEVICE_EXTERN on clang >= 22 (deduction guides).
bf16 storage as signed short.

The %prep rewriter also walks the mslk / flash-attn / aiter copies.

